## Combat System [to-do]
### Damage Calculation:
- Total attack power = base_offense * battalion_quantity
- Defense reduction: damage = attack * (1 - defense/100)
- Minimum damage of 1 point
- Individual battalion total health tracking
- Damage application after defense calculation
- Destruction at 0 total health

